        From 6385a3d73454acd09d38e3cd7e98eda6acd0a0c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jean-Baptiste Kempf <jb@videolan.org>
Date: Sat, 13 Aug 2011 13:39:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] PS: fix an error introduced in f10b7234e27

Else the check on i doesn't make sense
